    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d3f4bf3ad12c6f2d8579586",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别是我母亲……虽然祖母也是知名赛马娘，\n但母亲更是缔造出惊人的成就，\n让众人开始将祖母说成“那位赛马娘的母亲”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eda231e8111147402c9a6bb841d36e544530370e291b5e01e125f528ed46ec3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
