      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我很了解她母亲的事迹。\n她是赢得知名重要比赛的传奇赛马娘，\n至今仍是新马级赛道的纪录保持人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb4c487400e69bb9e266a7290bedc5006cc81a81ef51680a65fb67f65db2d922",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
