      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "三后冠路线是以仅限经典级挑战的\n“樱花赏”、“橡树大赛”及“秋华赏”\n为目标的华丽路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7aa677bc4e4eac077f0cc1421cc440abae9f18517f523f077809ee18a82bb6bf",
